            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo HS-050, 4.5 Inch x .060 Thick Hinge Shim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n4-1/2\" High x 1/2\" Wide x .060 Thick metal hinge shim. Used for  4-1/2\" high hinges on wood or metal doors. Steel construction can be used on fire doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see: Thicker hinge shim <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-x-1-2-x-090-hinge-shim-don-jo-hs-080\"><b>Don-Jo HS-080</b></a> and <a href=\"/pages/how-to-install-door-hinge-shims\"><b>How to install hinge shims</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-HS-050_size.gif?v=1704354580\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo HS-050 Hinge Shim size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo HS-050 Metal Hinge Shim Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Hight: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .060\" (16 Gauge)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Primer</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HS-050.pdf?v=1704262389\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo HS-050 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
